      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I seem to see the play button not working with `SyncVideoStream`. \nBut weirdly enough, the RPCs for `SyncVideoPlayer` are working for me. Contrary to what this Canny is titled. (But `SyncVideoPlayer` has its own other issue(s) right now)",
